 sustainment upgrade contract","src":"DefenseScoop","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQMDJDdXV1by1ISlhQRnpQYmxkUmZnZWUxblVKbWFaVXM3Y3lJbUQxNXo1SWhhdnZxMktUal9ZdVh1SE90cmVENmNvWXVGNUpWVjRkR0VpMk1RREVFQjFiclBrMkdmaGtBVlh5R2FfWk5HQlFRbERkcHNsUGNaMzhlS3lYRzQxOVBMTGhmcFpVX0t1Y0ZTQWc?oc=5","date":"2026-11-24","zh":"太空系統司令部計畫於 2028 年中期簽訂 GPS 維持升級合約"},{"title":"Key facts: Lockheed Martin Raises Outlook; Mizuho Top Defense Pick","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOM2JkeG5KRm45ZTByVnA4M1dtajFVX0I4b2lzYXVNWWZxejBKb0hFTWZMNkRwTS10LTd1aEtHNXR6VGtDNnA2WmpGWUdRaVROM3VGQmpwR1NUTU1UenVzVS00a3Jhenk1d3ZRLWNja0c3RXRWTUw2SGRHcFdCd0pZUGJ2MFFjQ244MlFvcmlzVVFfOGlhTWZhenlGYjVSTkhwOU5kWFFvUHEwdlp1bkxOZE5kS3VGc1k1d2doelhVZkRzY3ZS?oc=5","date":"2026-11-24","zh":"關鍵事實：洛克希德馬丁公司提高了前景；瑞穗頂級防守選擇"},{"title":"After reaching Mach 1.53, Lockheed Martin formally delivers X-59 to NASA","src":"Air Data News","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQWVRwSUxBeE9NeWpaaXVzdUR3empEcnYwQk5xbXFMVnJ1OHdIVzc3YjFOcks5RkJvQTR4ZUdzdlZBNHpkajRWZTc5WEc3QUY5VENZSTJNV0txU2JNVFdhZ2xiZEhXR1I2Q1hLSG5raTBMMzlZLU1nQm5sdFRaOEF1MlR6WXBDRUN1cTd5bTBNTW42VmZZM0RkUEdRTFlHdENEX2c?oc=5","date":"2026-11-24","zh":"達到 1.53 馬赫後，洛克希德馬丁公司正式向 NASA 交付 X-59"}],"themes":[{"name":"國防/軍工","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-29","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/936468/000162828026004195/lmt-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a global aerospace and defense technology company that builds and sustains the solutions America and its allies need to deter conflict and advance national security and scientific exploration objectives. Our four business areas – Aeronautics, Missiles and Fire Control, Rotary and Mission Systems, and Space – work as one company offering integrated solutions, at scale, across all warfighting domains. Our defense, space, intelligence, homeland security, information technology, and cybersecurity capabilities serve U.S. and international customers in defense, civil and commercial applications. Our principal customers are agencies of the U.S. Government and allies.","zh":"我們是一家全球航空航太和國防技術公司，致力於建構和維護美國及其盟國所需的解決方案，以遏制衝突並推進國家安全和科學探索目標。我們的四個業務領域——航空、飛彈和火控、旋轉和任務系統以及航太——作為一家公司在所有作戰領域提供大規模的綜合解決方案。我們的國防、太空、情報、國土安全、資訊科技和網路安全能力為美國和國際客戶的國防、民用和商業應用提供服務。我們的主要客戶是美國政府機構和盟友。"},{"en":"Recent regional conflicts have demonstrated the integral role Lockheed Martin products play in protecting people, and we are rapidly transforming our business to meet increased demand. We are expanding production capacity to continue delivering at scale, and we are harnessing leading-edge technologies like artificial intelligence and autonomy, open-architecture systems, and advanced networking to make defense forces more agile, adaptive and unpredictable. Our goal is to deliver overwhelming capability and value – quickly, at the needed quantities and with the greatest effectiveness – to enable overmatch and strengthen deterrence today and into the future.","zh":"最近的地區衝突證明了洛克希德馬丁公司的產品在保護人員方面發揮著不可或缺的作用，我們正在迅速轉變我們的業務以滿足不斷增長的需求。我們正在擴大生產能力，以繼續大規模交付，我們正在利用人工智慧和自主、開放式架構系統和先進網路等領先技術，使國防軍更加敏捷、適應性強和不可預測。我們的目標是快速、以所需的數量和最大的效率提供壓倒性的能力和價值，以實現超越並加強當今和未來的威懾力。"},{"en":"We achieve this by developing and investing in differentiating technologies, forging strategic partnerships, including with commercial companies, executing on our multi-year business transformation initiative, maintaining fiscal discipline, and continuing to cultivate the greatest aerospace and defense workforce talent and culture in the world. We invest substantially in our people to ensure that our people have the technical skills necessary to succeed, and we expect to continue to invest internally in innovative technologies that address rapidly evolving mission requirements for our customers. We also will continue to evaluate our organizational structure and portfolio and will make strategic changes, acquisitions or divestitures, as appropriate, while deepening our connection to commercial industry through cooperative partnerships, joint ventures and equity investments.","zh":"我們透過開發和投資差異化技術、建立戰略合作夥伴關係（包括與商業公司）、執行我們的多年業務轉型計劃、維持財政紀律以及繼續培養世界上最優秀的航空航天和國防勞動力人才和文化來實現這一目標。我們對員工進行大量投資，以確保我們的員工擁有成功所需的技術技能，並且我們希望繼續在內部投資於創新技術，以滿足客戶快速變化的任務需求。我們也將繼續評估我們的組織結構和投資組合，並視情況進行策略性變革、收購或剝離，同時透過合作夥伴關係、合資企業和股權投資加深我們與商業行業的聯繫。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We operate in four business segments: Aeronautics, Missiles and Fire Control (MFC), Rotary and Mission Systems (RMS) and Space. We organize our business segments based on the nature of the products and services offered.","zh":"我們經營四個業務部門：航空、飛彈和火控 (MFC)、旋轉和任務系統 (RMS) 以及航太。我們根據所提供的產品和服務的性質來組織我們的業務部門。"},{"en":"Aeronautics is engaged in the research, design, development, manufacture, integration, sustainment, support and upgrade of advanced military aircraft, including combat and air mobility aircraft, unmanned air vehicles and related technologies. Aeronautics also has contracts with the U.S. Government for various classified programs. Aeronautics' major programs include:","zh":"航空從事先進軍用飛機的研究、設計、開發、製造、整合、維護、支援和升級，包括戰鬥和空中機動飛機、無人機及相關技術。航空業也與美國政府簽訂了各種機密項目的合約。航空學的主要項目包括："}],"customers":[{"en":"The F-35 program is our largest program, generating 27% of our total consolidated sales, as well as 67% of Aeronautics' sales in 2025. The F-35 program consists of multiple development, production and sustainment contracts. Development is focused on modernizing F-35's capability and addressing emerging threats. Sustainment provides logistics and training support for the aircraft delivered to F-35 customers. Aircraft production is expected to continue well into the future given the U.S. Government's stated objective of procuring 2,456 aircraft for the U.S. Air Force, U.S. Marine Corps, and U.S. Navy. We also have commitments from seven international partner countries and 12 FMS customers, who collectively during the year indicated their intent to purchase 72 additional aircraft beyond their existing programs of record. The F-35 program is significant and complex, and we, our customers, an","zh":"F-35 項目是我們最大的項目，占我們綜合銷售額的 27%，以及到 2025 年航空部門銷售額的 67%。 F-35 項目由多項開發、生產和維護合約組成。開發重點是 F-35 能力現代化和應對新出現的威脅。保障部門為交付給 F-35 客戶的飛機提供後勤和培訓支援。鑑於美國政府既定的為美國空軍、美國海軍陸戰隊和美國海軍採購 2,456 架飛機的目標，預計飛機生產在未來仍將持續。我們也得到了 7 個國際合作夥伴國家和 12 個 FMS 客戶的承諾，他們在這一年共同表示有意在現有記錄項目之外購買 72 架飛機。 F-35 專案意義重大且複雜，我們，我們的客戶，"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with many different companies both within and outside of the defense and aerospace industry. The Boeing Company, General Dynamics, L3Harris Technologies, Northrop Grumman, and RTX Corporation are some of our primary competitors. Key characteristics of our industry include long operating cycles and intense competition, which is evident through the number of competitors bidding on program opportunities and the existence of bid protests (competitor protests of U.S. Government procurement awards).","zh":"我們與國防和航空航天行業內外的許多不同公司競爭。波音公司、通用動力公司、L3Harris Technologies、Northrop Grumman 和 RTX Corporation 是我們的一些主要競爭對手。我們行業的主要特徵包括營運週期長和競爭激烈，這一點從競標專案機會的競爭對手數量和競標抗議（美國政府採購獎的競爭對手抗議）的存在中可以看出。"},{"en":"We often collaborate with our competitors through teaming arrangements in efforts to provide our customers with the best mix of capabilities to address specific requirements. Additionally, a company competing to be a prime contractor may, upon ultimate award of the contract to another competitor, serve as a subcontractor to the ultimate prime contracting company. It is not unusual to compete for a contract award with a peer company and, simultaneously, perform as a supplier to or a customer of that same competitor on other contracts.","zh":"我們經常透過團隊安排與競爭對手合作，努力為客戶提供最佳的功能組合，以滿足特定要求。此外，競爭成為主承包商的公司在最終將合約授予另一競爭對手後，可以作為最終主承包商公司的分包商。與同行公司競爭合約授予，同時在其他合約上作為同一競爭對手的供應商或客戶，這種情況並不罕見。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Aeronautics","val":30257000000,"zh":"航空"},{"name":"Rotary & Mission Systems","val":17312000000,"zh":"旋翼與任務系統"},{"name":"Missiles & Fire Control","val":14450000000,"zh":"飛彈與火控"},{"name":"Space","val":13029000000,"zh":"太空"}],"total":75048000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":62654000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":12394000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":75048000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":53705000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":8805000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":7815000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Middle East","val":2864000000,"zh":"中東"},{"name":"Other Region","val":1859000000,"zh":"其他地區"}],"total":75048000000}},"peers":["NOC","GD","RTX","BA","HON"]}}